  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Long Sleeve Henley T-shirt. Crafted for everyday wear, the casual military shirt features a round neck and 3-button placket closure, allowing you to work comfortably and dress fashionably. From business outings to weekend trips, the henley shirt is a classic staple for any wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": null,
  "description": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Long Sleeve Henley T-shirt. Crafted for everyday wear, the casual military shirt features a round neck and 3-button placket closure, allowing you to work comfortably and dress fashionably. From business outings to weekend trips, the henley shirt is a classic staple for any wardrobe. Reliable and Long-Lasting: The breathable cotton / polyester fabric blend easily withstands outdoor activities while remaining soft and comfortable. For added durability and convenience, these comfortable long sleeve shirts feature a tag-less neck label and reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem. Standard Fit: The henley collar t-shirts are designed with a standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for any activity. The rugged fashion t-shirt sits approximately at the waist for full coverage and comfort. In addition, the ribbed knit wrist cuffs allow you to find the perfect fit. Great for Layering: These long sleeve work shirts are great for either wearing on their own or as a base layer undershirt. They fit comfortably underneath vests, jackets, and coats, while also looking good when paired with our MA-1 Flight Jacket or Field Jacket Liners. Versatile Everyday Tee: Available in unique camouflage patterns and solid colors, these classic henley shirts are great for outdoor adventures, traveling, work, college, and casual wear. They&rsquo;re also perfect for the winter, summer, spring, and fall, ensuring all-season comfort.</p>",
